php-duckdb (1.3.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build the pinned DuckDB engine with nullable storage and Arrow fixes.
  * Install the engine privately with a distinct SONAME and loader path,
    allowing Debian and Ubuntu system DuckDB packages to coexist.
  * Stage engine sources offline and reuse verified shared SDK caches.

 -- Martin Juul Christiansen <code@juul.xyz>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

